{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55399","headline":"十玄谈（幷序） 尘异 · 常察","name":"十玄谈（幷序） 尘异","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浊者自浊清者清，菩提烦恼等空平。\n谁言卞璧无人鉴，我道骊珠到处晶。\n万法泯时全体现，三乘分处假（《大正》本、《偈颂》作「别假」）安名。\n丈夫皆（《偈颂》作「自」）有冲天志，不（《大正》本、《偈颂》作「莫」）向如来行处行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常察","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55399.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55399","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}